         &nbsp;<br>121&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>FPUS53&nbsp;KDTX&nbsp;131947&nbsp;<br>ZFPDTX&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>Southeast&nbsp;Michigan&nbsp;Zone&nbsp;Forecasts&nbsp;<br>National&nbsp;Weather&nbsp;Service&nbsp;Detroit/Pontiac&nbsp;MI&nbsp;<br>347&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ047-140815-&nbsp;<br>Midland-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;city&nbsp;of&nbsp;Midland&nbsp;<br>347&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;slight&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;<br>lower&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;<br>20&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;partly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;North&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;<br>mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Northeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;<br>5&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;<br>the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;East&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;<br>50&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Rain.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;<br>to&nbsp;5&nbsp;mph,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;25&nbsp;mph&nbsp;after&nbsp;<br>midnight.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;90&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;partly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;50&nbsp;percent&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening&nbsp;then&nbsp;clearing.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;<br>in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY...Sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;partly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TUESDAY...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>$$&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ048-140815-&nbsp;<br>Bay-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;city&nbsp;of&nbsp;Bay&nbsp;City&nbsp;<br>347&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;slight&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;<br>lower&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;<br>20&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;partly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;North&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;<br>mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Northeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;<br>with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;<br>the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;East&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;50&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Rain.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;<br>to&nbsp;5&nbsp;mph,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;25&nbsp;mph&nbsp;after&nbsp;<br>midnight.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;90&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Windy.&nbsp;Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;<br>partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;50&nbsp;percent&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;<br>50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Breezy.&nbsp;Partly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening&nbsp;then&nbsp;<br>clearing.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY...Sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;partly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TUESDAY...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>$$&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ049-140815-&nbsp;<br>Huron-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;city&nbsp;of&nbsp;Bad&nbsp;Axe&nbsp;<br>347&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;50.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;<br>10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;<br>winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;15&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Northeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;<br>up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;<br>the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;<br>40&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Rain.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;<br>to&nbsp;5&nbsp;mph,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;west&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;25&nbsp;mph&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;<br>Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;90&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Windy,&nbsp;rain.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;<br>90&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Windy.&nbsp;Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;<br>evening.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;30&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Breezy,&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;partly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;partly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TUESDAY...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>$$&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ053-140815-&nbsp;<br>Saginaw-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;city&nbsp;of&nbsp;Saginaw&nbsp;<br>347&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening,&nbsp;then&nbsp;a&nbsp;slight&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;<br>rain.&nbsp;Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;early&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;<br>Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;20&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;partly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;North&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;<br>mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Northeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;<br>the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;East&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;50&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Rain.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;<br>to&nbsp;5&nbsp;mph,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;15&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;25&nbsp;mph&nbsp;<br>after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;90&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Breezy.&nbsp;Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;<br>partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;50&nbsp;pe